SUMMARY:Glow\, Game and Groove
DESCRIPTION:Join Inclusive Arts Alliance and Mirror Image Dance Company for Glow\, Game & Groove — a community event celebrating Neurodiversity and diversity within abilities. \nThis event creates a fun\, welcoming space where youth of all abilities can participate in ways that feel comfortable to them. \nEvent Zones Include:\nGlow Dance Party\nGaming Trucks\nArt-tism Creative Art Area\nSensory Reset Room\nPhoto Wall \nTwo Time Blocks:\n4:00–5:30 PM (Grades 1–6)\n5:30–7:00 PM (Grades 7–12) \nImportant:\nThis is not a drop-off event.\nAn adult must remain with each child for the duration. \nRSVP required.\nWe can’t wait to celebrate with you.
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/glow-game-and-groove/
LOCATION:Mirror Image Dance Company\, 2121 2nd St.\, Suite A106\, Davis\, CA\, 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Glow-Game-Groove-417.png
END:VEVENT
