SUMMARY:Jim Scott - For the Earth - A Concert for Our Home
DESCRIPTION:Earth Day concert by composer\, guitarist and singer Jim Scott. Jim brings a warmth and humor with his jazz/world music influenced songs. He uses a prodigious guitar mastery and clear voice for his messages of peace\, and ecology. Formerly a member of the Paul Winter Consort\, their anthem song Common Ground. He’s toured the world\, recorded nine CDs of original music. \nFriday\, April 17th at 7pm\, at Unitarian Universalist Church of Davis 27074 Patwin Rd\, Davis \n$20 suggested donation -cash only tickets at the door.
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/jim-scott-for-the-earth-a-concert-for-our-home/
LOCATION:Unitarian Universalist Church of Davis\, 27074 Patwin Rd\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
CATEGORIES:Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/For-the-Earth-Davis-4.17.26-copy.png
